Why: v0.36.0 selected Chromium popup labels with speculative pid-routed typeahead, which can reach a sibling without confirmed key routing and commit intermediate or invalid prefix selections; use the existing exact-match semantic AX popup route instead.

Includes a regression test that fails with the v0.36.0 behavior.

